<a name="python"></a>
## 4️⃣ Option C – **Python** (`🤗 Transformers + bitsandbytes`)

### 4.1 Install CPU‑only libraries (run once)

```bash
# CPU‑only PyTorch (no CUDA)
pip install torch==2.4.0+cpu -f https://download.pytorch.org/whl/torch_stable.html

# Transformers + bitsandbytes for 4‑/8‑bit quantisation
pip install transformers bitsandbytes accelerate
```

> If you’re on a minimal container, you may also need: `sudo apt install -y build-essential python3-dev`.

### 4.2 Load a 4‑bit quantised model (Mistral‑7B‑Instruct)

```python
from transformers import AutoModelForCausalLM, AutoTokenizer
import torch, bitsandbytes as bnb
